; The FlatZinc front end is deliberately standalone: it depends on no other library in
; this project. Baguette_core is being rewritten in parallel (M1-T1..T5) and the front
; end's output type lives here, in model.ml, so that `dune build lib/flatzinc/` is
; meaningful on its own. The `flatzinc -> core` edge of docs/ARCHITECTURE.md gets added
; when the engine is wired up.
;
; No menhir stanza: enabling one requires `(using menhir X.Y)` in dune-project, which is
; owned elsewhere. lexer.ml/parser.ml are hand written; see the header of lexer.ml.
